# With Convenient Target's enters trigger on the stack Bot2 Disenchants the Aura: "suspect enchanted creature" uses the
# Aura's last known information (CR 608.2h), so the Memnite it enchanted as it left is suspected all the same, as the
# ruling says the suspicion outlasts the Aura.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Convenient Target
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Convenient Target.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Convenient Target)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Convenient Target
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = true
